<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Dense Muscles</ansi> mutation

Your muscles condense into cables of extraordinary power. Strength
surges, but endurance suffers.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive (Colossus)
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Uncommon

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Moderately increased strength — your condensed muscle fibers
  generate extraordinary force — and you can haul far heavier loads
  than your frame suggests

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Slightly slower stamina recovery — the dense tissue demands more
  energy to sustain

<ansi fg="yellow">Conflicts:</ansi> Hollow Bones

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
